010","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1788#issuecomment-810513010","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1788","id":810513010,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxMDUxMzAxMA==","user":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-03-30T19:14:52Z","updated_at":"2021-03-30T19:14:52Z","body":"Hmm I put together a quick minimal test and so far I havent been able to repro. If this is a bug, I don't think the scope is as large as the title implies:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n#[test]\r\nfn sparse_set_without() {\r\n    let mut world = World::default();\r\n    struct Test;\r\n    world\r\n        .register_component(ComponentDescriptor::new::<Test>(StorageType::SparseSet))\r\n        .unwrap();\r\n    let e1 = world.spawn().insert(1i32).insert(Test).id();\r\n    let e2 = world.spawn().insert(2i32).id();\r\n    let mut query = world.query_filtered::<(Entity, &i32), Without<Test>>();\r\n    let mut entities = Vec::new();\r\n    for (e, _) in query.iter(&world) {\r\n        entities.push(e);\r\n    }\r\n    assert_eq!(entities, vec![e2]);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI'll start poking at the bevy code in question next, but if anyone can produce a minimal example that repros, that would be very helpful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/810513010/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/810518737","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1788#issuecomment-810518737","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/1788","id":810518737,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDgxMDUxODczNw==","user":{"login":"Byteron","id":24433899,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDMzODk5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24433899?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron","html_url":"https://github.com/Byteron","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Byteron/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-03-30T19:25:02Z","updated_at":"2021-03-30T19:25:27Z","body":"with this I can reproduce it.\r\nI spawn one sprite, but the test system prints 2.\r\n```rust\r\nuse bevy::{\r\n    ecs::component::{ComponentDescriptor, StorageType},\r\n    prelude::*,\r\n};\r\n\r\npub struct SomeStruct;\r\n\r\nfn main() {\r\n    App::build()\r\n        .register_component(ComponentDescriptor::new::<SomeStruct>(\r\n            StorageType::SparseSet,\r\n        ))\r\n        .add_plugins(DefaultPlugins)\r\n        .add_startup_system(setup.system())\r\n        .add_system(test.system())\r\n        .run()\r\n}\r\n\r\nfn setup(\r\n    mut commands: Commands,\r\n    assets: Res<AssetServer>,\r\n    mut materials: ResMut<Assets<ColorMaterial>>,\r\n) {\r\n    let sprite_handle = materials.add(assets.load(\"icon.png\").into());\r\n\r\n    commands\r\n        .spawn()\r\n        .insert_bundle(OrthographicCameraBundle::new_2d());\r\n\r\n    commands.spawn().insert_bundle(SpriteBundle {\r\n        material: sprite_handle.clone(),\r\n        transform: Transform::from_translation(Vec3::ZERO),\r\n        sprite: Sprite::new(Vec2::splat(64.0)),\r\n        ..Default::default()\r\n    });\r\n}\r\n\r\nfn test(query: Query<&Sprite, Without<SomeStruct>>) {\r\n    println!(\"Count: {}\", query.iter().count());\r\n}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/810518737/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"ho